factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 3 problems
  The reel_script says the students 'directly went into the field' (நேரடியாக வயலில் இறங்கி) as a headline-level claim, while the article says the professors, officials and students all went into the field together; the reel_script says only 'பேராசிரியர்களும் மாணவர்களுடன்', so the framing of students alone going into the field is not directly stated, though the article does say students planted paddy.
  The reel_script states students 'must do all work from ploughing to harvest' as an obligation and then says the 4-cent land is given to them to grow paddy themselves; the article says this is the university's programme requirement, which is consistent, but the reel_script omits that the planting was done by the 2nd and 3rd year students specifically under the practical programme, and the slide title 'மாணவர்களின் பணி' is fine; however the caption and slides say the planting is in 'நன்செய் பண்ணை' which matches the article.
  The reel_script and slides omit that the event was an inauguration (தொடக்க விழா) where the Coimbatore university's principal officers, heads of departments and professors were welcomed by subject professor S.T. Sivakumar, and that Head of Department of Agronomy spoke on management methods; the welcome by S.T. Sivakumar is missing from the script.
