factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  reel_script and slides say the 500 ரூபாய் fee applies to Attakatti Hornbill View Point, Nallamudi and Chinnakallar View Point together; the article only states the 500 ரூபாய் fee applies to those points, which is consistent, but the slides/reel omit that the fee for Attakatti/Nallamudi/Chinnakallar is 500 (slides list it under 'மற்ற இடங்கள' without the 500 figure, so the slide omits the fee for Attakatti, Nallamudi and Chinnakallar)
  slides_spec 'மற்ற இடங்கள' slide lists Attakatti Hornbill View Point and Nallamudi with no fee, while the article gives 500 ரூபாய for them; the fee information is incomplete and mixes Attakatti/Nallamudi with the 100 ரூபாய Thalanar fee
  reel_script says '30 ரூபாயும், இருசக்கர வாகனத்துக்கு 20 ரூபாயும்' with the first item lacking its subject: the draft writes 'பயணியர்: 30 ரூபாய்' in slides, which wrongly describes the entry fee as a per-passenger fee for Valparai travelers; the article only says entry fee 30 ரூபாய without specifying a per-person subject, so the slide label 'பயணியர்' is an unsupported detail
