  reel_script omits the key fact that the Valparai entry fee is charged at the Aliyar checkpost for vehicles as well, instead presenting it only as fees for tourists (the article says the complaint is that vehicles going to Valparai are also charged)
  reel_script says the association 'வசூலின் நோக்கத்தை வனத்துறை தெளிவுபடுத்த வேண்டும்' but omits who made the complaint about vehicles and the specific statement by tourists that fees for vehicles are not acceptable, which is an important fact of the article
